WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.867
This query displays order timestamps using two time
zones AT TIME

00:00:05.893 --> 00:00:11.832
ZONE America slash New York gives an Eastern local
clock representation AT

00:00:11.858 --> 00:00:17.374
TIME ZONE UTC gives a UTC clock representation Run

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.952
the query and compare the displayed times The
underlying event instant

00:00:22.978 --> 00:00:26.004
is the same only the clock representation changes
